    {
      "title": "Two police officers hailed as heroes for confronting Kraków gunman",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/08/two-police-officers-heroes-confronting-krakow-gunman-poland",
      "description": "<p>Jakub Kulik critically injured and Artur Morański also wounded after actions that ‘prevented further casualties’</p><p>Two Polish police officers who were injured as they pursued and detained the gunman in Kraków on Saturday have been hailed as heroes.</p><p>One of them is Jakub Kulik, a former paratrooper and volunteer firefighter, who was left critically injured after a close-range exchange of fire with the suspect, a 24-year-old Polish national who killed six and injured 17 in an attack believed to have been inspired by far-right ideologies.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/08/two-police-officers-heroes-confronting-krakow-gunman-poland\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-08T14:49:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Polish prosecutors open terrorism investigation into Kraków shooting",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/08/krakow-shooting-poland-terrorism-investigation",
      "description": "<p>Six people killed in attack probably inspired by far right, according to officials, as police say suspect’s parents and sister found dead at his home</p><p>Polish prosecutors have opened a terrorism investigation after a 24-year-old man <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/krakow-poland-shooting-market-square-deaths-gunman\">opened fire in a busy market square</a> in Kraków, killing six people including a Briton and injuring 17, in an attack that authorities said was probably inspired by far-right ideologies.</p><p>Police confirmed on Sunday that three people found dead at the gunman’s home after the attack on Saturday afternoon were his father, 53, mother, 52, and sister, 21.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/08/krakow-shooting-poland-terrorism-investigation\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-08T11:50:15"
    },
    {
      "title": "Poland mourns six killed in attack as authorities launch ‘terrorism’ probe",
